# UE5 C++ Gameplay Conventions

## Headers & Includes
- `#pragma once`, then `CoreMinimal.h`, engine types, then `TypeName.generated.h` last.
- Match module naming: `ProjectOrganoid*.h` / `AProjectOrganoid*` / `UProjectOrganoid*`.
- Forward-declare in headers; include in `.cpp` when possible.

## Blueprint / UMG Exposure
Expose gameplay-facing data with `UPROPERTY` / `UFUNCTION`:

```cpp
// ✅ Tunables & vitals for designers / UMG
UPROPERTY(EditAnywhere, BlueprintReadWrite, Category = "Vitals")
float PEEnergy = 100.f;

UPROPERTY(VisibleAnywhere, BlueprintReadOnly, Category = "Vitals")
float HeartRateBPM = 72.f;

// ✅ Input / actions
UPROPERTY(EditAnywhere, Category = "Input")
TObjectPtr<UInputAction> TacticalModeAction;
```

- Use `Category` names that match systems: `Vitals`, `Tactical`, `Inventory`, `Weapons`, `PE`.
- Prefer `TObjectPtr<>` for UObject pointers.
- BlueprintCallable for player-facing verbs (`DoMove`-style); keep internals protected.

## Tactical Mode Constants (defaults)
- Time dilation: `0.2f` while active
- Target sphere radius: `800.0f`
- PE Energy max: `100.0f`
